{% extends "base.html.j2" %}

{% block title %}
{% if language == 'tr' %}Etkinliğiniz Onaylandı - {{ event_title }}{% elif language == 'en' %}Your Event Has Been Approved - {{ event_title }}{% else %}Uw Event is Goedgekeurd - {{ event_title }}{% endif %}
{% endblock %}

{% block header_subtitle %}
<p>
    {% if language == 'tr' %}
        Event talebiniz onaylandı
    {% elif language == 'en' %}
        Your event submission has been approved
    {% else %}
        Uw event inzending is goedgekeurd
    {% endif %}
</p>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
{% if language == 'tr' %}
<p>Merhaba {{ user_name }},</p>

<p>Harika haber! <strong>{{ event_title }}</strong> için yaptığınız event inzending onaylandı. Event is nu toegevoegd aan de events lijst.</p>

<p>Het event is nu zichtbaar voor alle gebruikers op de events pagina.</p>

<p>Als u vragen heeft, aarzel dan niet om contact met ons op te nemen.</p>

<p>Bedankt,<br>Het Turkspot Team</p>

{% elif language == 'en' %}
<p>Hello {{ user_name }},</p>

<p>Great news! Your event submission for <strong>{{ event_title }}</strong> has been approved. The event has now been added to the events list.</p>

<p>The event is now visible for all users on the events page.</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out to us.</p>

<p>Thank you,<br>The Turkspot Team</p>

{% else %}
<p>Hoi {{ user_name }},</p>

<p>Goed nieuws! Uw event inzending voor <strong>{{ event_title }}</strong> is goedgekeurd. Het event is nu toegevoegd aan de events lijst.</p>

<p>Het event is nu zichtbaar voor alle gebruikers op de events pagina.</p>

<p>Als u vragen heeft, aarzel dan niet om contact met ons op te nemen.</p>

<p>Bedankt,<br>Het Turkspot Team</p>
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}

